---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Copyright Information | Study Hub"
  description="Information about rights in Study Hub content and third-party learning resources, and how to report a rights concern."
>
  <main class="legal-page">
    <header class="legal-page-heading">
      <p class="eyebrow">Content and permissions</p>
      <h1>Copyright Information</h1>
      <p>The Study Hub library contains original site material and learning resources from different authors and sources. Rights remain with their respective owners unless a page or rights holder states otherwise.</p>
      <p class="policy-updated">Last updated <time datetime="2026-10-14">October 14, 2026</time></p>
    </header>

    <article class="legal-copy">
      <section>
        <h2>Study Hub content</h2>
        <p>The Study Hub name, site design, original descriptions, and original written material are protected by the rights held by their respective owners. Unless a page states otherwise, do not republish or commercially reuse that original content without permission, except where applicable law allows.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Third-party learning resources</h2>
        <p>Study notes, examination papers, guides, images, and other files may belong to their authors, schools, publishers, examination bodies, or other rights holders. Their presence in the library does not transfer ownership, certify accuracy, or give visitors permission to redistribute them.</p>
        <p>Check the rights that apply before copying, adapting, or sharing a resource. Use materials only as permitted by the rights holder or applicable law.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Contributed materials</h2>
        <p>Only submit a file if you are entitled to share it for review and possible inclusion in the library. A submission is reviewed before publication. Submitting a file does not transfer ownership to Study Hub; if accepted, the file may be made available to visitors through the library.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Report a rights concern</h2>
        <p>If you believe a resource is included without permission or otherwise infringes your rights, email <a href="mailto:trusteth777@gmail.com?subject=Study%20Hub%20copyright%20concern">trusteth777@gmail.com</a>. Include the resource or page title, where it appears, your relationship to the rights, and enough detail for Study Hub to identify and review the material. Do not include sensitive information that is not needed to explain the concern.</p>
        <p>Study Hub will review the information and may restrict or remove material while a concern is assessed. Please contact Study Hub if further information is needed.</p>
      </section>
    </article>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
